WEBVTT

52:36.555 --> 52:38.932
(FOREIGN ACCENT) You are late, boy.

52:41.017 --> 52:43.311
Tomorrow you will be here at midday.

52:43.437 --> 52:45.689
Who are you?

52:46.440 --> 52:49.609
Your dancing master, Syrio Forel.

52:53.905 --> 52:55.365
Tomorrow you will catch it.

52:55.490 --> 52:57.284
Now pick it up.

52:59.745 --> 53:02.038
That is not the way, boy.
